{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault and defend positions. Exploit cover and terrain. Call in artillery strikes and use special units. Storm trenches, conquer villages and urban neighborhoods . Command your troops from a classic Real-Time Tactics perspective, or take direct control of any soldier or vehicle on the battlefield. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real Time Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple squads, tanks and infantry fighting vehicles to accomplish mission objectives. Order them to take cover,<strong><i> </i></strong>maneuver\u00a0with your force in order to get a better position over the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Direct Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When commanding the battlefield as a commander is not enough, you can turn the tide of an engagement by entering direct control of any allied soldier or vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Units Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the abilities of the Lieutenant, Platoon Sargent, Medic and Engineer are vital to your platoon's survival and victory on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battlefield Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infantry and vehicles should support each other, each is vulnerable without the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Infantry Direct Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the battle from another perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Direct Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking direct control of a tank or infantry fighting vehicle to quickly destroy enemy armor with precision or halt an infantry charge with superior firepower is a reliable way to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jankiness\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadly, some elements of jank are present.\u00a0They are not game breaking. They are not very frequent and most gameplay is smooth, but when they occur some players could find them annoying. To accommodate this, &quot;Platoon&quot; will be sold at a cheaper price than originally planned. And overall gameplay and level design is redirected to provide as smooth player experience as possible. Most, if not all levels will take under 15 minutes to accomplish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, are you ready to take command of your platoon, Lieutenant ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/408e4c0e0f2fea61f633fab6a16d4cbf.avif?t=1757488636\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simplified, more casual wargame. This is not a hardcore &amp; realistic milsim. You will not deal with ammo, inventory management, building fortifications, resupplying your troops, reviving wounded soldiers. I want you to focus on the strategy, tactics and action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014230?t=1757488636","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/089bdc472ca073bf1091700e4be188c7c52672bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757488636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/160d0f46af14c4a28cce9d6fadc07bf3fe9fd2d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757488636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/160d0f46af14c4a28cce9d6fadc07bf3fe9fd2d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757488636","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The enemy military force portrayed in this game employs conventional military tactics, as well as car bombs and suicide vest bombers. The car bombs and suicide vest bombers are only used on the battlefield itself. There are no civilians in this game. No offensive language, no offensive words and no caricature of any kind is suggested. My aim is to deliver a fun game without offending anyone.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault and defend positions. Exploit cover and terrain. Call in artillery strikes and use special units. Storm trenches, conquer villages and urban neighborhoods . Command your troops from a classic Real-Time Tactics perspective, or take direct control of any soldier or vehicle on the battlefield. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real Time Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/f74387e9daab86fa8a59e7b9466975e3.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control multiple squads, tanks and infantry fighting vehicles to accomplish mission objectives. Order them to take cover,<strong><i> </i></strong>maneuver\u00a0with your force in order to get a better position over the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Direct Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/286a11763e966fa2b08c8a4d00f24f3b.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When commanding the battlefield as a commander is not enough, you can turn the tide of an engagement by entering direct control of any allied soldier or vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Units Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/1ba8693e21d5fa8a7ef55f29f1748de0.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the abilities of the Lieutenant, Platoon Sargent, Medic and Engineer are vital to your platoon's survival and victory on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battlefield Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/4290bc0a9880067947ad040f30966df4.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infantry and vehicles should support each other, each is vulnerable without the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Infantry Direct Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/d23b0d5ed1c98c77f48c37c518e35163.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the battle from another perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Direct Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/23a9f6ea0a1fbe7a9da01e3799eb5aec.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking direct control of a tank or infantry fighting vehicle to quickly destroy enemy armor with precision or halt an infantry charge with superior firepower is a reliable way to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jankiness\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.poster.avif?t=1757488636\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.webm?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/c3091e7261c57f2fa7f291c87065a7bd.mp4?t=1757488636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadly, some elements of jank are present.\u00a0They are not game breaking. They are not very frequent and most gameplay is smooth, but when they occur some players could find them annoying. To accommodate this, &quot;Platoon&quot; will be sold at a cheaper price than originally planned. And overall gameplay and level design is redirected to provide as smooth player experience as possible. Most, if not all levels will take under 15 minutes to accomplish.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, are you ready to take command of your platoon, Lieutenant ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/extras/408e4c0e0f2fea61f633fab6a16d4cbf.avif?t=1757488636\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simplified, more casual wargame. This is not a hardcore &amp; realistic milsim. You will not deal with ammo, inventory management, building fortifications, resupplying your troops, reviving wounded soldiers. I want you to focus on the strategy, tactics and action.</p>","developers":["Vitezi Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3984970","name":"Platoon"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014230/2128d5f524d1ee5d0a2fe1a594232c0f03e642c0/header.jpg?t=1757488636","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Platoon Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit - Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-1315U (8 CPUs), ~1.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics - a toaster laptop can run this <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek(R) Audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Storage size may change for final release</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit - Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-9100F CPU @ 3.60GHz (4 CPUs), ~3.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> NVIDIA/Realtek High Definition Audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game was developed and runs smoothly on a computer with this specs</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":[" Vitezi Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"10 Sep, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Assault and defend positions. Exploit cover and terrain. Call in artillery strikes and use special units. Storm trenches, conquer villages and urban neighborhoods. Command your troops from a classic Real-Time Tactics perspective, or take direct control of any soldier or vehicle on the battlefield.","steam_appid":4014230,"support_info":{"email":"svitezi24@gmail.com","url":""},"type":"demo","website":null}